snippet.textDisplay:
@magnatcleo2043 He has attention to flashyness, not what the transformers are actually about. 

The G1 transformers are actually the more realistic because their transformations came from toys you can actually complete in real life. Bayverse transformations only make sense in body distribution and that's it. 

Without it, bayverse transformations make even less sense, and stray far from what transformers design ideas were about. They are cool and that can't be denied, but over all they don't accomplish what transformers transformations were actually about, actually being something you could accomplish physically with the thing in your very real hands.

