snippet.textDisplay:
@Josh-99That is what autonomous weapons would be, do you think because you put in targeting data and you don’t have to steer a missile somehow it’s autonomous?
Autonomous weapons are in production, drones that patrol an area, recognize a target, and deploy. they will def ask permission from an operator at first, but eventually if it is not legislated away it might deploy its charges automatically.
All countries are headed towards this, eliminating or letting a drone operator handle dozens or more drones at a time is when war becomes hell like we’ve never seen it.

